{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18301640","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18301640","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1830164001:1":{"text":"何年もお金を貯めて、やっとノヴァリスに来られたというのに……あんたって人は……あんたって人は！！","source_cn":"我准备了这么多年，好不容易才来到诺珐斯，就想着能再见一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76D33344773AF0C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830164002:1":{"text":"――よりによって、こっちで新しい家庭を築いているなんて！","source_cn":"——你竟然在这边有了新的家庭！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81A74061C98773CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830164003:1":{"text":"僕はもう、こっちへ来て二十年になるんだよ。君だって、とっくに新しい人と一緒だろうと……","source_cn":"罗莎……我已经去世二十年了，我以为你肯定会忘了我的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x417BD968CCE43EAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1830164004:1":{"text":"ローザ……もう過去のことは忘れるんだ！僕みたいな死人のために、君の人生を無駄にしないでくれ！","source_cn":"放下过去吧，罗莎……你该向前看了。别让我这样一个死人耽...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1B50F3467817F0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1830164005:1":{"text":"レイド……よくもそんなことが言えるわね！？","source_cn":"雷德……你怎么能说出这样的话？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6950CCFEAF91382B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1830164006:1":{"text":"あっ……実はもう「レイド」じゃなくて、今は「タイアード」っていう名前なんだよね……","source_cn":"呃，其实我现在已经不叫雷德了，我叫累德。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C8C91C82E470EEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1830164007:1":{"text":"タイアード……？どんなふざけた名前なのよ！","source_cn":"……累德？多么愚蠢的名字！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x634CFD9B64C1E59B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1830164008:1":{"text":"あんたの顔なんて、もう一生見たくない！いえ、二生見たくないわ！","source_cn":"我这辈子再也不想见到你了！不……我连死后也不要再见到你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94665BC972CA7D71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:罗莎":{"text":"ローザ","source":"罗莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:累德":{"text":"タイアード","source":"累德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}